{"id":322,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"グローバル体験で世界とつながる昭和中高","feature_description":"グローバル教育では、中学3年間をかけてボストン研修の事前学習・現地体験・事後発表に取り組みます。歴史や文化を調べ、現地の授業や近隣校との交流、フィールドトリップを経験し、学びをクラスで共有します。コースに応じた研修や英語での発表も設け、研修後は調査内容を発表して振り返ります。語学力と異文化への理解を深め、将来の目標を考える機会につなげます。","clubs":[{"id":6120,"name":"テニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jhs.swu.ac.jp/schoollife/club_activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6121,"name":"ソフトテニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jhs.swu.ac.jp/schoollife/club_activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6122,"name":"ドッジボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jhs.swu.ac.jp/schoollife/club_activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6123,"name":"水泳","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jhs.swu.ac.jp/schoollife/club_activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6124,"name":"陸上競技","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jhs.swu.ac.jp/schoollife/club_activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6125,"name":"ダンス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jhs.swu.ac.jp/schoollife/club_activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6126,"name":"バスケットボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jhs.swu.ac.jp/schoollife/club_activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6127,"name":"ソフトボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jhs.swu.ac.jp/schoollife/club_activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6128,"name":"ゴルフ","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jhs.swu.ac.jp/schoollife/club_activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6129,"name":"卓球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jhs.swu.ac.jp/schoollife/club_activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6130,"name":"バドミントン","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jhs.swu.ac.jp/schoollife/club_activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6131,"name":"剣道","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jhs.swu.ac.jp/schoollife/club_activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6132,"n